                {
                  "type": "script",
                  "code": "\n\t# No OEE asset to chart: nothing selected, or a site or an area (one asset at a time: buildInstances)\n\tinfo \u003d value[\u0027nav\u0027]\n\treturn not value[\u0027over\u0027] and not value[\u0027instances\u0027] and not (info and info.get(\u0027oeeEnabled\u0027))"
