                  "code": "\n\t# The assets under the asset in custom.navAsset (every enterprise when there\u0027s none). A card doesn\u0027t open Asset Operation\n\t# here: the root\u0027s assetNavSelection handler selects it\n\tif not value: return {\u0027value\u0027: {\u0027assetId\u0027: None, \u0027assetName\u0027: \u0027\u0027, \u0027assetPath\u0027: \u0027\u0027, \u0027openOperation\u0027: False, \u0027showRoot\u0027: True}}\n\treturn {\u0027value\u0027: {\u0027assetId\u0027: value[\u0027assetId\u0027], \u0027assetName\u0027: value[\u0027assetName\u0027], \u0027assetPath\u0027: value[\u0027assetPath\u0027], \u0027openOperation\u0027: False, \u0027showRoot\u0027: False}}"
